{
  "declaredLength": 3536,
  "decoding": "confirmed-per-slot-XOR-rotate3-index-seed",
  "format": "GF Trinity encrypted UTF-16 message DAT",
  "initialKey": 0,
  "messages": [
    {
      "displayText": "只要有树果，\n不管什么甜甜圈我都会做！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 0,
      "offsetInSection": 572,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "53EA898167096811679CFF0C000A4E0D7BA14EC04E48751C751C5708621190FD4F1A505AFF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 20
    },
    {
      "displayText": "决定口味的关键在于树果的搭配。\n欢迎来到安馨儿的甜甜圈店！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 612,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "51B35B9A53E3547376845173952E57284E8E6811679C7684642D914D3002000A6B228FCE676552305B8999A8513F7684751C751C57085E97FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 30
    },
    {
      "displayText": "说到甜甜圈啊，中间有个洞，\n在油炸时会更容易受热。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 672,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8BF45230751C751C5708554AFF0C4E2D95F467094E2A6D1EFF0C000A57286CB970B865F64F1A66F45BB9661353D770ED30020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "从甜甜圈的洞去看世界，\n会看到些什么呢？",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 724,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4ECE751C751C570876846D1E53BB770B4E16754CFF0C000A4F1A770B52304E9B4EC04E485462FF1F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 21
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我啊，\n可喜欢揉甜甜圈的面团了。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 768,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6211554AFF0C000A53EF559C6B2263C9751C751C57087684976256E24E8630020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 17
    },
    {
      "displayText": "发酵或不发酵，\n都会改变甜甜圈的口感。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 804,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "53D1917562164E0D53D19175FF0C000A90FD4F1A653953D8751C751C5708768453E3611F30020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 20
    },
    {
      "displayText": "欢迎来到旅馆Ｚ的小店——\n安馨儿的甜甜圈店！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 844,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6B228FCE6765523065C59986FF3A76845C0F5E9720142014000A5B8999A8513F7684751C751C57085E97FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我是异次元密阿雷调查的关键人物安馨儿，\n欢迎来到我的甜甜圈店！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 892,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6211662F5F026B2151435BC6963F96F78C0367E576845173952E4EBA72695B8999A8513FFF0C000A6B228FCE6765523062117684751C751C57085E97FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 32
    },
    {
      "displayText": "欢迎来到胡帕喜爱的甜甜圈店中排第一的\n安馨儿的甜甜圈店！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 956,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6B228FCE6765523080E15E15559C72317684751C751C57085E974E2D63927B2C4E007684000A5B8999A8513F7684751C751C57085E97FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "安馨儿我状态绝佳，\n不管什么甜甜圈都能做。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 1016,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5B8999A8513F621172B660017EDD4F73FF0C000A4E0D7BA14EC04E48751C751C570890FD80FD505A30020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 22
    },
    {
      "displayText": "您好，几位！\n……我模仿了一下寿司店的说法。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 1060,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "60A8597DFF0C51E04F4DFF01000A2026202662116A214EFF4E864E004E0B5BFF53F85E9776848BF46CD530020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "可以说阿罗拉地区的马拉萨达\n也是一种甜甜圈哦。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 1108,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "53EF4EE58BF4963F7F5762C95730533A76849A6C62C984288FBE000A4E5F662F4E0079CD751C751C570854E630020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "把甜甜圈的美味\n传遍全世界吧！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 1156,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "628A751C751C570876847F8E5473000A4F20904D51684E16754C5427FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 16
    },
    {
      "displayText": "虽然我已经做过很多甜甜圈了，\n但还想做更多更多！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 1188,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "867D713662115DF27ECF505A8FC75F88591A751C751C57084E86FF0C000A4F468FD860F3505A66F4591A66F4591AFF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 25
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我要做出能够承受超级能的\n最棒的甜甜圈！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 1240,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62118981505A51FA80FD591F627F53D78D857EA780FD7684000A670068D27684751C751C5708FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 21
    },
    {
      "displayText": "最多可以用４个树果！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 1284,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6700591A53EF4EE57528FF144E2A6811679CFF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 11
    },
    {
      "displayText": "最多可以用５个树果！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 1308,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6700591A53EF4EE57528FF154E2A6811679CFF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 11
    },
    {
      "displayText": "最多可以用６个树果！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 1332,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6700591A53EF4EE57528FF164E2A6811679CFF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 11
    },
    {
      "displayText": "最多可以用７个树果！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 1356,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6700591A53EF4EE57528FF174E2A6811679CFF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 11
    },
    {
      "displayText": "最多可以用８个树果！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 1380,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6700591A53EF4EE57528FF184E2A6811679CFF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 11
    },
    {
      "displayText": "辣、鲜、甜、苦、酸，\n要哪种口味呢？",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 1404,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8FA330019C9C3001751C300182E630019178FF0C000A898154EA79CD53E354735462FF1F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 19
    },
    {
      "displayText": "请你多多制作甜甜圈，\n不断地推进调查吧！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 1444,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8BF74F60591A591A52364F5C751C751C5708FF0C000A4E0D65AD573063A88FDB8C0367E55427FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 21
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我会加热黄油，\n做成融化黄油备着！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 1488,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62114F1A52A070ED9EC46CB9FF0C000A505A6210878D53169EC46CB959077740FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 18
    },
    {
      "displayText": "要是一次性多做一些甜甜圈，\n就不用回旅馆Ｚ咯。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 1524,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8981662F4E006B216027591A505A4E004E9B751C751C5708FF0C000A5C314E0D752856DE65C59986FF3A54AF30020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "诀窍就是磨碎树果\n直到细腻顺滑。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 1572,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8BC07A8D5C31662F78E8788E6811679C000A76F452307EC6817B987A6ED130020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 17
    },
    {
      "displayText": "密阿雷的甜甜圈\n要放很多砂糖吧？",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 1608,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5BC6963F96F77684751C751C5708000A8981653E5F88591A78027CD65427FF1F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 17
    },
    {
      "displayText": "用我的甜甜圈和胡帕的力量\n来协助你的调查。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 26,
      "offsetInSection": 1644,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "752862117684751C751C5708548C80E15E157684529B91CF000A6765534F52A94F6076848C0367E530020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 22
    },
    {
      "displayText": "请找出合适的树果搭配\n来发挥出你想要的效果。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 27,
      "offsetInSection": 1688,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8BF7627E51FA5408900276846811679C642D914D000A676553D1632551FA4F6060F3898176846548679C30020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "甜甜圈的洞明明是什么都“没有”，\n却会被认为“有”洞，很有意思吧？",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 28,
      "offsetInSection": 1736,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "751C751C570876846D1E660E660E662F4EC04E4890FD201C6CA16709201DFF0C000A53744F1A88AB8BA44E3A201C6709201D6D1EFF0C5F886709610F601D5427FF1F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 34
    },
    {
      "displayText": "话说回来……\n异次元树果真是种神秘的树果啊。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 29,
      "offsetInSection": 1804,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8BDD8BF456DE676520262026000A5F026B2151436811679C771F662F79CD795E79D876846811679C554A30020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "好好留意增幅等级\n也很重要。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 30,
      "offsetInSection": 1852,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "597D597D7559610F589E5E457B497EA7000A4E5F5F8891CD898130020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 15
    },
    {
      "displayText": "饱腹能量不多的话，\n调查时间也会减少的哦。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 31,
      "offsetInSection": 1884,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "9971817980FD91CF4E0D591A76848BDDFF0C000A8C0367E565F695F44E5F4F1A51CF5C11768454E630020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 22
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我想做出能让人\n容易遇到头目的甜甜圈！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 32,
      "offsetInSection": 1928,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "621160F3505A51FA80FD8BA94EBA000A5BB9661390475230593476EE7684751C751C5708FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 20
    },
    {
      "displayText": "能让人容易遇到\n异色宝可梦的甜甜圈也不错啊。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 33,
      "offsetInSection": 1968,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "80FD8BA94EBA5BB9661390475230000A5F0282725B9D53EF68A67684751C751C57084E5F4E0D9519554A30020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "风味级别提高的话，\n甜甜圈的效果也会更强哦！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 34,
      "offsetInSection": 2016,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "98CE54737EA7522B63D09AD876848BDDFF0C000A751C751C570876846548679C4E5F4F1A66F45F3A54E6FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "胡帕也很喜爱\n甜味的甜甜圈！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 35,
      "offsetInSection": 2064,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "80E15E154E5F5F88559C7231000A751C54737684751C751C5708FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 15
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我有种预感，甜味甜甜圈\n会很受异色宝可梦的欢迎。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 36,
      "offsetInSection": 2096,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6211670979CD9884611FFF0C751C5473751C751C5708000A4F1A5F8853D75F0282725B9D53EF68A676846B228FCE30020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 25
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我认为甜味甜甜圈\n能带来与运气相关的效果。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 37,
      "offsetInSection": 2148,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62118BA44E3A751C5473751C751C5708000A80FD5E2667654E0E8FD06C1476F8517376846548679C30020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 22
    },
    {
      "displayText": "辣味的咖喱甜甜圈\n很有旅馆Ｚ的风格啊！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 38,
      "offsetInSection": 2192,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8FA354737684549655B1751C751C5708000A5F88670965C59986FF3A768498CE683C554AFF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 20
    },
    {
      "displayText": "辣味应该能提升\n宝可梦的攻击力吧？",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 39,
      "offsetInSection": 2232,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8FA354735E948BE580FD63D05347000A5B9D53EF68A67684653B51FB529B5427FF1F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 18
    },
    {
      "displayText": "辣味甜甜圈应该会在\n攻击时带来有利的效果。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 40,
      "offsetInSection": 2268,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8FA35473751C751C57085E948BE54F1A5728000A653B51FB65F65E2667656709522976846548679C30020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 22
    },
    {
      "displayText": "胡帕也喜欢酸味系的甜甜圈\n那种微酸的味道。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 41,
      "offsetInSection": 2312,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "80E15E154E5F559C6B22917854737CFB7684751C751C5708000A90A379CD5FAE917876845473905330020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 22
    },
    {
      "displayText": "带上更容易获得树果的甜甜圈，\n去多多收集树果吧！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 42,
      "offsetInSection": 2356,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5E264E0A66F45BB9661383B75F976811679C7684751C751C5708FF0C000A53BB591A591A653696C66811679C5427FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 25
    },
    {
      "displayText": "酸味甜甜圈似乎会\n带来和道具有关的效果。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 43,
      "offsetInSection": 2408,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "91785473751C751C57084F3C4E4E4F1A000A5E266765548C905351776709517376846548679C30020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 21
    },
    {
      "displayText": "别看胡帕那样，\n其实它也喜欢苦味哦。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 44,
      "offsetInSection": 2452,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "522B770B80E15E1590A36837FF0C000A51765B9E5B834E5F559C6B2282E6547354E630020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 19
    },
    {
      "displayText": "如果能减轻特定属性的招式\n造成的伤害就好了。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 45,
      "offsetInSection": 2492,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5982679C80FD51CF8F7B72795B9A5C5E6027768462DB5F0F000A9020621076844F245BB35C31597D4E8630020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我认为苦味能带来\n对防御有利的效果。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 46,
      "offsetInSection": 2540,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62118BA44E3A82E6547380FD5E266765000A5BF996325FA16709522976846548679C30020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 19
    },
    {
      "displayText": "鲜味的甜甜圈\n会刺激胡帕的味觉。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 47,
      "offsetInSection": 2580,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "9C9C54737684751C751C5708000A4F1A523A6FC080E15E157684547389C930020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 17
    },
    {
      "displayText": "想捉宝可梦的时候，\n我推荐你选鲜味甜甜圈哦。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 48,
      "offsetInSection": 2616,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "60F363495B9D53EF68A6768465F65019FF0C000A621163A883504F6090099C9C5473751C751C570854E630020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "鲜味甜甜圈似乎会\n带来和捕捉有关的效果。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 49,
      "offsetInSection": 2664,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "9C9C5473751C751C57084F3C4E4E4F1A000A5E266765548C635563496709517376846548679C30020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 21
    },
    {
      "displayText": "会有什么样的效果呢？\n等甜甜圈做好后就知道了！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 50,
      "offsetInSection": 2708,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F1A67094EC04E48683776846548679C5462FF1F000A7B49751C751C5708505A597D540E5C3177E590534E86FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "这是为超级甜甜圈大作战\n制作的特别特殊的甜甜圈！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 51,
      "offsetInSection": 2756,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8FD9662F4E3A8D857EA7751C751C570859274F5C6218000A52364F5C76847279522B72796B8A7684751C751C5708FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 25
    },
    {
      "displayText": "带上树果超多的甜甜圈，\n去和固拉多相见吧！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 52,
      "offsetInSection": 2808,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5E264E0A6811679C8D85591A7684751C751C5708FF0C000A53BB548C56FA62C9591A76F889C15427FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 22
    },
    {
      "displayText": "带上多多使用树果制作的甜甜圈，\n去和盖欧卡相见吧！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 53,
      "offsetInSection": 2852,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5E264E0A591A591A4F7F75286811679C52364F5C7684751C751C5708FF0C000A53BB548C76D66B27536176F889C15427FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "带上使用了大量树果的甜甜圈，\n去和烈空坐相见吧！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 54,
      "offsetInSection": 2904,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5E264E0A4F7F75284E86592791CF6811679C7684751C751C5708FF0C000A53BB548C70C87A7A575076F889C15427FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 25
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我有预感会做出\n最棒的等离子闪电甜甜圈！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 55,
      "offsetInSection": 2956,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "621167099884611F4F1A505A51FA000A670068D276847B4979BB5B5095EA7535751C751C5708FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 21
    },
    {
      "displayText": "你会不会为了做出\n奇怪的甜甜圈而烦恼呢？",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 56,
      "offsetInSection": 3000,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F604F1A4E0D4F1A4E3A4E86505A51FA000A5947602A7684751C751C5708800C70E6607C5462FF1F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 21
    },
    {
      "displayText": "不管是哪种树果的搭配，\n我都会做出甜甜圈的。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 57,
      "offsetInSection": 3044,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E0D7BA1662F54EA79CD6811679C7684642D914DFF0C000A621190FD4F1A505A51FA751C751C5708768430020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "看来你正在烦恼\n要做什么样的甜甜圈啊。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 58,
      "offsetInSection": 3092,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "770B67654F606B63572870E6607C000A8981505A4EC04E4868377684751C751C5708554A30020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 20
    },
    {
      "displayText": "与其犹豫这，犹豫那，\n不如做更多的甜甜圈吧！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 59,
      "offsetInSection": 3132,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E0E517672B98C6B8FD9FF0C72B98C6B90A3FF0C000A4E0D5982505A66F4591A7684751C751C57085427FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>，\n你愣住了。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 60,
      "offsetInSection": 3180,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0010000201000000FF0C000A4F6061234F4F4E8630020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 12
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>，\n你发呆的样子也挺好。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 61,
      "offsetInSection": 3204,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0010000201000000FF0C000A4F6053D15446768468375B504E5F633A597D30020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 17
    },
    {
      "displayText": "制作甜甜圈这件事\n就是创造幸福。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 62,
      "offsetInSection": 3240,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "52364F5C751C751C57088FD94EF64E8B000A5C31662F521B90205E78798F30020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 17
    },
    {
      "displayText": "在制作甜甜圈这件事上，\n遵守基础和投入感情都很重要。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 63,
      "offsetInSection": 3276,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "572852364F5C751C751C57088FD94EF64E8B4E0AFF0C000A90755B8857FA7840548C62955165611F60C590FD5F8891CD898130020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 27
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我会竭尽全力做出\n让宝可梦觉得好吃的甜甜圈！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 64,
      "offsetInSection": 3332,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62114F1A7AED5C3D5168529B505A51FA000A8BA95B9D53EF68A689C95F97597D54037684751C751C5708FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "据说通过饮食偏好\n就能了解一个人。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 65,
      "offsetInSection": 3380,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "636E8BF4901A8FC7996E98DF504F597D000A5C3180FD4E8689E34E004E2A4EBA30020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 18
    },
    {
      "displayText": "毕竟民以食为天嘛。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 66,
      "offsetInSection": 3416,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6BD57ADF6C114EE598DF4E3A5929561B30020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 10
    },
    {
      "displayText": "烹饪最重要的是基础。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 67,
      "offsetInSection": 3436,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "70F9996A670091CD89817684662F57FA784030020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 11
    },
    {
      "displayText": "请你好好考虑吧。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 68,
      "offsetInSection": 3460,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8BF74F60597D597D80038651542730020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 9
    },
    {
      "displayText": "慢慢来，不着急。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 69,
      "offsetInSection": 3480,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "616261626765FF0C4E0D7740602530020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 9
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我憧憬的厨师\n其实是那位志米先生。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 70,
      "offsetInSection": 3500,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "621161A761AC768453A85E08000A51765B9E662F90A34F4D5FD77C735148751F30020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 18
    }
  ],
